                <p>
                    Special attention must be paid to the growing segment of "Specialized Electronics Care." As vehicles become "computers on wheels," the demand for non-conductive, fast-evaporating cleaners has skyrocketed. Products like Dielectric Contact Cleaners are now indispensable for maintaining the integrity of ADAS sensors, infotainment systems, and electric vehicle (EV) battery management systems. This niche represents a significant opportunity for startups focusing on high-tech automotive maintenance.
